Description: Three days in Kyoto: shrines, temples and the bamboo grove.
Subject: travel
Subject: Japan
Note: Sample disc made by samples/make-samples.sh; the photos are generated.
Location: BOX1
Access: public
Media: M-DISC custom medium
Files: 16
Bytes: 9443
Filesystem: ISO9660 level 3 + Rock Ridge + Joliet, UDF 1.02 bridge
Ecc: dvdisaster RS03 augmented image, custom medium (3200 sectors), minimum 20% redundancy
Software: bluray-archival-workflow@5f594f28f853
Copies: 2
Location: OFFSITE

